### CustomersOpinions.Transactional.Api — sample requests
### Set @apiKey to the same value configured with:
###   dotnet user-secrets set "Security:ApiKey" "<key>" --project src/Transactional/CustomersOpinions.Transactional.Api

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7181
@apiKey = <paste-your-key-here>

### 200 - health check (no API key required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 200 - first page with the default page size (500)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 200 - explicit paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments?pageNumber=2&pageSize=50
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 200 - page out of range returns empty items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments?pageNumber=999&pageSize=500
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 200 - pageSize above Paging:MaxPageSize is clamped to 1000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5000
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 400 - invalid pageNumber
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments?pageNumber=0&pageSize=500
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 400 - invalid pageSize
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments?pageNumber=1&pageSize=0
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 401 - missing API key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments

### 401 - wrong API key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/social-comments
X-Api-Key: wrong-key
